---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '@/components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '@/components/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions — Friends Factory Cafe Vadodara"
  description="Terms and conditions for booking at Friends Factory Cafe, Vadodara. Cancellation policy, rescheduling rules, payment terms and venue guidelines for all romantic celebration packages."
  canonicalPath="/terms-conditions"
  noTemplate={false}
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-white">
    <Header />
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-16 max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 font-serif">Terms & Conditions</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">Last updated: January 2025</p>

      <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none space-y-6 text-gray-700">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">1. Booking & Confirmation</h2>
          <p>A booking is confirmed only after you receive a confirmation message from our team on WhatsApp. Advance payment or booking token may be required to secure your slot.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">2. Cancellation Policy</h2>
          <p><strong>No Refund Policy:</strong> All bookings at Friends Factory Cafe are non-refundable. Once your booking is confirmed, cancellation will not entitle you to a refund of any advance payment made.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">3. Rescheduling Policy</h2>
          <p>Your event may be rescheduled provided that:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc ml-6 space-y-1">
            <li>Rescheduling is requested at least <strong>24 hours before</strong> your booked slot.</li>
            <li>The new date must be within <strong>one month</strong> from the original booking date.</li>
            <li>Rescheduling is subject to slot availability.</li>
            <li>Only one rescheduling is permitted per booking.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">4. Duration & Venue Access</h2>
          <p>Each package includes 3 hours of exclusive venue access. Additional time beyond the booked slot is not guaranteed and is subject to availability at extra cost. Guests are requested to arrive within 10 minutes of the slot start time.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">5. Venue Rules</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc ml-6 space-y-1">
            <li>Strictly couple/family only — no group gatherings or parties with alcohol.</li>
            <li>Outside food and beverages are not permitted unless pre-approved.</li>
            <li>Guests are expected to treat the venue, décor, and property with respect. Any damage will be charged accordingly.</li>
            <li>The venue is a private, safe space — guests are expected to maintain appropriate conduct.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">6. Liability</h2>
          <p>Friends Factory Cafe is not liable for personal belongings left on the premises. Photography/videography during celebrations is encouraged, but the venue is not responsible for any loss of photos or media.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">7. Contact</h2>
          <p>For queries, contact us on WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/917487888730" class="text-amber-600 hover:underline">+91 74878 88730</a> or email: <a href="mailto:hello@friendsfactorycafe.com" class="text-amber-600 hover:underline">hello@friendsfactorycafe.com</a></p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
    <Footer />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
